            "value": "X, Y, Z, and W are integers. The expression X \u05d2\u02c6\u2019 Y \u05d2\u02c6\u2019 Z is even and the expression Y \u05d2\u02c6\u2019 Z \u05d2\u02c6\u2019 W is odd. If X is even what must be true?"
