            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. 54 minutes."
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "E. 66 minutes."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: C \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Define X as the average speed to the country club and Y as the average speed on the way back."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The average speed of the entire round trip to the club is 87.5% of the average speed on the way to the club:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "(X + Y) / 2 = 0.875X,"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "X + Y = 1.75X,"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Y = 0.75X."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The average speed on the way back is 75% of the speed to the club."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "If the time it takes her to get to the country is T, then T/0.75 is the time it will take to get back home."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "50/0.75 = approximately 66 minutes."
          }
        ]
      },
